      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-amali-saduq:73:4",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/29/1/74/4",
      "text": [
        "، قال: كان الصادق جعفر بن محمد (عليه السلام) يقول لكل أناس دولة يرقبونها * * ودولتنا في آخر الدهر تظهر (3)"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bilal-muhammad": [
          "By this isnad, he said: Al-Sadiq Ja`far b. Muhammad (as) would say: For every people is a government that they draw near to, And our government at the End of Time will manifest."
        ]
      }
    },
